# Coin Island from a new save: start a new game, take the three coins on the way east, walk up to
# the crab and get bitten, then go through the door to the cave and take the gem. The game is
# saved on quitting, in the cave.
5 confirm down
7 confirm up
12 move_right down
120 move_right up
120 move_up down
150 move_up up
200 move_down down
224 move_down up
224 move_right down
400 move_right up
420 end
